{'symbol': 'DE', 'date': '2022-09-01 09:00:00', 'title': 'DEERE BOARD ELECTS JOSH JEPSEN AS CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER', 'text': 'MOLINE, ILL. , SEPT. 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DEERE & COMPANY (NYSE: DE) ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS ELECTED JOSH JEPSEN, 44, AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER (CFO), EFFECTIVE SEPTEMBER 16.'}